OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' leaders who called on
OL,4,Aelection chief to quit are freed from
OL,5,Ajail
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo leaders of the Gen Z-led Cockroach
OL,8,FJanta Party (CJP) have been freed from
OL,9,Fjail a week after they were arrested
OL,10,Ffor trespassing at a banned protest
OL,11,Fsite in Delhi.
OL,13,FSaurav Das and Ashutosh Ranka walked
OL,14,Fout of Tihar jail hours after a
OL,15,Fmagistrate ordered their release. They
OL,16,Fhad been detained by police and jailed
OL,17,Fafter they crossed barricades and
OL,18,Fclimbed over the locked gate at Jantar
OL,19,FMantar.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
