OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' leaders who called on
OL,4,Aelection chief to quit are freed from
OL,5,Ajail
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe historic venue was recently removed
OL,8,Ffrom a list of designated protest
OL,9,Fsites.
OL,11,FThe men, who denied wrongdoing, have
OL,12,Fbeen calling on India's chief election
OL,13,Fcommissioner to resign. Critics accuse
OL,14,Fthe commission of manipulating voter
OL,15,Frolls to benefit India's governing
OL,16,Fparty, charges the commission rejects.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
